{"id": "524edd8f387d281474b8041c8ea49189", "text": "where r\u0101\u1e63\u1e6dra = worldly miseries and dh\u1e5bta = the one bearing.  Hence, the \nname dh\u1e5btar\u0101\u1e63\u1e6dra represents a student, and indeed,  all of us who are \nimmersed in worldly afflictions. The name sa\u00f1jaya  is m ade up of root \nwords samyak  and jayati  (the one who has soundly conquered worldly \nmiseries)  and represents a teacher who has overcome worldly miseries .", "embedding": [-0.06982261687517166, 0.05924027040600777, -0.07543788105249405, 0.06220509484410286, -0.12537795305252075, -0.08982030302286148, 0.016252819448709488, 0.02456817775964737, 0.0513450987637043, -0.059197571128606796, 0.05035264790058136, -0.03754153102636337, 0.03668806329369545, 0.031535908579826355, -0.012198043055832386, 0.044451043009757996, 0.020095378160476685, 0.08247590065002441, -0.06222297623753548, -0.07168614119291306, 0.019655302166938782, 0.051095038652420044, 0.018740037456154823, -0.09485200047492981, 0.032052766531705856, 0.07650987803936005, 0.02509423904120922, -0.032806944102048874, 0.012250443920493126, -0.024567488580942154, 0.05507199093699455, 0.034925539046525955, -0.02127690240740776, -0.005597925744950771, 0.0070693353191018105, 0.02347925677895546, -0.05589893087744713, 0.08469000458717346, 0.046360693871974945, -0.05256800726056099, 0.07919036597013474, 0.05615374073386192, 0.03747878596186638, -0.06950453668832779, -0.03633720055222511, -0.09627021849155426, -0.08989447355270386, -0.007464928086847067, 0.011815907433629036, 0.00637539429590106, -0.04180280119180679, -0.11764790862798691, -0.057007186114788055, 0.040693700313568115, 0.05093011260032654, -0.10338255017995834, 0.007702816277742386, -0.007645098026841879, 0.05620312690734863, 0.05976453796029091, 0.022448208183050156, 0.029207423329353333, 0.0037385490722954273, 0.013370846398174763, 0.0039058614056557417, -0.14413204789161682, 0.007929354906082153, -0.027544034644961357, -0.028139661997556686, 0.03586585819